TC-CTBP5001-006
Test Scenario
Verify that a record already transmitted via CTS is NOT re-extracted
Test Data
A record that was previously transmitted successfully via CTS and has already received an ACCEPTED status message (i.e. CTS_TX_REC.TX_STS='T')(BTBP5002)
Expected Result
That record must not reappear in this extraction run's results
SELECT M.MS_ID, M.RPT_YR, M.RX_CTRY, F.FCE_TIN, TR.TX_STS, S.VAL_RSLT
FROM ctsg_enc.FILING_INFO F, ctsg_enc.GIR_MSG_SPEC M, ctsg_enc.CTS_DATA_PACKET DP,
     ctsg_enc.CTS_TX_REC TR, ctsg_enc.CTS_STS_MSG S
WHERE F.MS_ID = M.MS_ID AND M.MS_ID = DP.MS_ID AND DP.DP_ID = TR.DP_ID
  AND DP.STS_ID = S.STS_ID
  AND TR.TX_STS = 'T' AND S.VAL_RSLT = 'ACCEPTED';
